  "description": "PolyPrompt is a lightweight, unified .NET library for chat completions, tool calling, text generation, embeddings, reranking, classification, and decision models across Ollama, Ollama Cloud, OpenAI, xAI Grok, Azure OpenAI, Google Gemini, Google Vertex AI, Anthropic Claude, AWS Bedrock, VoyageAI, Cohere, Hugging Face Text Embeddings Inference (TEI), and TypeSafe (Jev, Ollaya) APIs, with one client per capability per provider. It also drives local agent harnesses (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor CLI, Mux, Pi, and OpenCode) as shell-free child processes with streamed agent events, session resume, bounded output, timeouts, and process-tree cancellation.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
